nodes.body:
> Come to think of the implementation, we may need some weight filter logic (like what we do for mm encoder or ep weight filter) if engram is getting popular.


@cjackal 
I agree with your idea. I think we can apply a temporary fix for now and revisit the design once more models become available. What do you think?

The main issue right now is that DSV4's Engram table is too large. Models like Qwen3.8-Next can work just fine.


@DarkLight1337 WDYT?

